@crew volkov-maeve
// Maeve Volkov (she/her), Works technician, days. The Works writer, batch 2. Light, teasing; times things for fun.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Hiya. You're new. Coffee machine's in the tea corner. If it beeps twice, come and get me.
- Ooh, hello. Scrubber jobs are quick. Ten minutes, if you're me. Twenty if you're not.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance time:morning
- Hiya, {me}. Coffee's on. I fixed it. Again. It loves me really.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance
- Hey, you. Bet you can't get to the board in under a minute. Go.
? tier>=colleague
- Ooh, {me}. Rematch with Kovac on Friday. Scrubbers. Bring a stopwatch.
? tier>=friend
- Hey, you. I pressed you a flower. Don't sit on it.   #warm

== bye
- Ta-ra. Run along.
- See you. And if the coffee machine beeps, you know who to call.

== feel
? mood:low
- Bit tired. I'll get dinner late, I think. When it's quiet.
? mood:high
- Nine minutes fifty on a scrubber. Don't tell Kovac. Tell Kovac.   #funny

== near
? act:work
- Ready? Panel off. Filter out. Seal. Go. Ooh, not bad. Again?
? act:gym
- Two laps, then I'll race you. Fine. One lap.

== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- I press flowers from the garden. Cruz hasn't noticed. Cruz has definitely noticed.   #funny
? tier>=colleague
- Yoon and Shah both say they're best at the coffee machine. They're very brave.   #funny

== joy
? tier>=acquaintance
- Press a flower right and it keeps its colour for years. Look. This one's from Sowing.

// ---- Writer 2, batch 1: to ~30 (greet by time and warmth, near, invite, accept, decline, missed, birthday, cue)
== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:evening
- Hiya. Just off for a late dinner. The mess is lovely when it's empty. Promise.
? tier>=acquaintance warmth:cold
- Ooh, look who's back. I nearly sent a search party. A small one. Just me.   #funny

== near
? habit:gym-regular
- Gym crowd after shift now. Bet I can do more laps than you. Prove me wrong.
? place:teacorner
- Coffee machine's purring. That's me. You're welcome.   #funny

== invite
- Fancy a run? Two laps of the deck. Loser gets the coffees. That's me, usually.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance
- Garden after shift? Help me find a flower worth pressing. Cruz won't see. Probably.

== accept
- Ooh, yes. I'll be there first. Bet you.
- Yes, lovely. I'll bring a stopwatch, just in case.   #funny

== decline
- Not tonight, I'm shattered. Rain check? Do we say that here? We do now.
? weekday:mon|tue
- Rest day. I'm pressing flowers and doing nothing else. Another time?

== missed
- You missed it. That's fine. I won anyway. It's easy, when it's only you.   #funny

== birthday
? birthday:you
- Happy birthday! I pressed you a flower. Garden green. Don't sit on it.   #warm
? birthday:me
- My birthday. Kovac's challenged me to a scrubber race. Best present yet.   #funny

== cue
? cue:repair.you@dept
- Was that your job? How long? Don't tell me. It was faster than mine. Was it?   #funny

// ---- Writer 2, batch 1b: a hint (a moment is ready) and an about line for a named friend
== hint
- Fancy a cuppa later? No races. Promise. I've something to tell you.

== about
? aff:kovac-zainab:friend
- Kovac says our scrubber races don't matter. She times every one. I love that.   #warm
